  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Corrected documentation errors. A possible race in ConditionAsync has been corrected; a defect in caching for coalesce expressions has been corrected. General performance improvements to deferred expression evaluation, observed fields, and type binary expressions. Property change notifications with null or empty property names now trigger re-evaluation. General stability improvement to unary expressions. A defect has been corrected in collection count queries. A stack overflow in collection lookup queries has been corrected. Removed unnecessary null checks in collection sum queries. Corrected a defect in event subscription in collection synchronization queries. Corrected a potential deadlock in collection SynchronizationContext queries. Removed a no-op in dictionary where queries.",
